# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Pick a line: the north and west causeways are dry but walked by gulpers; the
# stepping stones in the middle are unguarded but only meet at their corners, so
# every hop drags you through the slime for a moment. Don't stop on the way.
name: Gulper Bog
time: 60
theme: madness
act: Act II: The Madness
story: Halfway down, the worlds have started arguing with each other.
story: Three ways across this bog. None of them is honest.
